* gf180_sdm3_mb6_nodwa.spice - 6-bit STRAIGHT-THERMOMETER (no DWA) (63-level) sdm3 variant for fs=512 kHz
* GENERATED by gen_sdm3_mb_nodwa.py - do not edit by hand.
* All behavioral B-sources are RC-smoothed current-source form
* (target-v)/R into a hold cap: ngspice-46 fails to converge on
* discontinuous B-source voltage branches (timestep-too-small at
* the input zero crossing, t=62.5026 ms). tau ~2 ns everywhere.
* Requires: gf180_afe_cells.spice (OTA/TG/bias) + gf180_sdm3.spice
* (strongarm, nand2, inv). Loop timing/coefficients identical to sdm3.
* Flash thresholds and DWA/thermometer logic are BEHAVIORAL (ideal
* sources / B-sources) - silicon needs a ladder + DWA RTL.

