* (nodwa: no pointer logic)
*
* B-source current sample/hold (idsw SW broke transient OP; RC form is OP-clean)
*
* int1 unit selects (straight thermometer): P-side unit j -> VP if j < 63-c.
* RC-smoothed current-source form (tau ~2 ns); sigmoid boundary errors
* cancel pairwise in the summed DAC charge.
